<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Espresso Menu | Suds & Sips Café</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --cream: #f7efe5;
      --paper: #fffaf4;
      --brown: #4b3025;
      --soft-brown: #7a5a4b;
      --terracotta: #c96f46;
      --line: #e3d1c2;
      --sage: #87917a;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--brown);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .topbar {
      padding: 18px 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(247, 239, 229, 0.96);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .topbar-inner {
      width: min(760px, 100%);
      margin: auto;
    }

    .back {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--brown);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero {
      width: min(760px, calc(100% - 28px));
      margin: auto;
      padding: 42px 0 24px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--terracotta);
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 9px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 12vw, 68px);
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 13px;
    }

    .intro {
      color: var(--soft-brown);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 580px;
    }

    .featured {
      width: min(760px, calc(100% - 28px));
      margin: 8px auto 18px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: var(--brown);
      color: white;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .featured-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: #efb18f;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .featured h2 {
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .featured-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .featured p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #eee1d8;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .featured-price {
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: 800;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .menu-card {
      width: min(760px, calc(100% - 28px));
      margin: 0 auto 50px;
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(75, 48, 37, 0.06);
    }

    .menu-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: start;
      padding: 15px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line);
    }

    .menu-item:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .item-name {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .item-note {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--soft-brown);
      margin-top: 3px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .price {
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 16px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-left: 7px;
      background: var(--terracotta);
      color: white;
      font-size: 9px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.7px;
      padding: 3px 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    .plant {
      color: var(--sage);
    }

    .addons {
      width: min(760px, calc(100% - 28px));
      margin: -28px auto 50px;
      padding: 20px;
      background: #ead5c5;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .addons h2 {
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 23px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .addon-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 15px;
      padding: 6px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px 40px;
      background: var(--brown);
      color: white;
    }

    footer h2 {
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 23px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    footer p {
      color: #ebdfd7;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <a class="back" href="index.html">← Back to Menu</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Coffee</div>
    <h1>Espresso</h1>
    <p class="intro">
      Classic espresso drinks, creamy lattes, and a few Suds & Sips favorites.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="featured">
    <div class="featured-label">Popular Pick</div>

    <div class="featured-row">
      <div>
        <h2>Spanish Latte</h2>
        <p>Smooth espresso with a sweet and creamy finish.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="featured-price">₱165</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="menu-card">

    <div class="menu-item">
      <div>
        <div class="item-name">Americano</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price">₱120</div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-item">
      <div>
        <div class="item-name">Café Latte</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price">₱160</div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-item">
      <div>
        <div class="item-name">Cappuccino</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price">₱160</div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-item">
      <div>
        <div class="item-name">
          Spanish Latte
          <span class="badge">Popular</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="price">₱165</div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-item">
      <div>
        <div class="item-name">Vanilla Latte</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price">₱165</div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-item">
      <div>
        <div class="item-name">Caramel Latte</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price">₱165</div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-item">
      <div>
        <div class="item-name">Salted Caramel</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price">₱165</div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-item">
      <div>
        <div class="item-name">Mocha Latte</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price">₱165</div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-item">
      <div>
        <div class="item-name">Ube Espresso</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price">₱165</div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-item">
      <div>
        <div class="item-name">Dirty Matcha</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price">₱170</div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-item">
      <div>
        <div class="item-name plant">Oat Beam 🌿</div>
        <div class="item-note">Oat-based</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price">₱180</div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-item">
      <div>
        <div class="item-name plant">Vanilla Bean Oat 🌿</div>
        <div class="item-note">Oat-based</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price">₱180</div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <section class="addons">
    <h2>Add-Ons</h2>

    <div class="addon-row">
      <span>Extra Espresso</span>
      <strong>₱50</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="addon-row">
      <span>Sea Salt</span>
      <strong>₱35</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="addon-row">
      <span>Oat Milk</span>
      <strong>₱55</strong>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <h2>Suds & Sips Café</h2>
    <p>Good drinks. Good food. Good vibes.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
